<a id="hello"></a>
## Hello

<a id="example-input"></a>
Example input:

<a id="code-block"></a>
```yaml
on: push
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - run: echo ${{ unknown }}
permissions: {}
```

<a id="output-header"></a>
Output:

<a id="output-block"></a>
```
test.yaml:6:23: unknown-variable: undefined variable "unknown". available variables are "env", "github", "inputs", "job", "matrix", "needs", "runner", "secrets", "steps", "strategy", "vars" [expression-reference]
  |
6 |       - run: echo ${{ unknown }}
  |                       ^~~~~~~
```

